            "html": "With the indicated minimum <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Magic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Magic</a> level (boostable), talking to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Maysa_the_Hag\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Maysa the Hag</a>, <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Netty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Netty</a>, <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Baba_Yaga\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Baba Yaga</a>, and <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Kardia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Kardia</a> will give a one-time Magic experience bonus when the broomstick is wielded.",
            "text": "With the indicated minimum Magic level (boostable), talking to Maysa the Hag, Netty, Baba Yaga, and Kardia will give a one-time Magic experience bonus when the broomstick is wielded.",
